        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosia omorwoti bw’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 22:1)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia nigo arenge nemiaka etano na etato, ekero achagete kogamba, na akagamba emiaka emerongo etato nomo, agwo Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agakora ayare amaronge ase amaiso ’Omonene; akabwatia chinchera chionsi chia Daudi, sokoro yaye; taonchogete gochia aande onsi, ensemo y’okorio gose ey’okobee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosia ogosiria ogosasimwa kw’emegwekano",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka o gatano na gatato bw’okogamba kwaye, ekero arenge omomura omoke, agachaaka komorigia Nyasae o Daudi, sokoro yaye. Ase omwaka o ikomi na kabere bw’okogamba kwaye agachaaka gosaria aase aimokererete igoro agosasimerwa na agachena ense y’Abayuda na Yerusalemu. Akanachana emete y’Asera amo nemegwekano yabaachire, na eyanyititoire na kobombwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bagatagora ebisasimero bie chinyasae chiria Baali agwo ase obosio bwaye; na Yosia agatagora na koiyeria inse ebisasimero bi’ogosambera ubani ase erioba, ebiatenenirie igoro y’ebio bia Baali. Akanachana emete y’Asera; boigo agasaria emegwekano yabaachire na kobombwa, akabisia bikaba orotu, akarosiara igoro ase chimbeera chi’abaanto baria barenge korua ebing’wanso ase emegwekano eyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agasambera amauga ’abakuani babo igoro ase ebisasimero biabo, agachena ense y’Abayuda na Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ase emechie y’orogongo rwa Manase, na orw’Efraimu, na orwa Simioni, na goika ase orogongo rwa Nafutali ase amatongo abo aande onsi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agatagora ebisasimero, akanachana emete y’Asera, na emegwekano y’ogosasimwa akabisia bikaba orotu. Ase ense yonsi y’Abaisraeli agatagora na koiyeria inse ebisasimero bi’ogosambera ubani ase erioba. Erio akairana gochia Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Egetabu ki’Amachiko gekonyorekana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 22:3-20)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka o ikomi na gatano na gatato bw’okogamba kwaye, ekero konya achenire ense eria na enyomba y’Omonene, Yosia agatoma Safani, mosinto bw’Asalia, na Maaseya, omogabana bw’omochie, na Yoa, mosinto o Yoahasi, omoriki bw’amang’ana are gokoreka, koroisia enyomba y’Omonene, Nyasae oye, ebe enyia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakairera Hilikia, Omokuani omonene, chitaabu echi konya chiarentirwe ase enyomba ya Nyasae, na chiria Abalawi na abarendi b’ebisieri basangereretie korwa ase Abamanase na Abaefraimu, na korwa ase abanto abatigari b’Abaisraeli, na korwa ase Abayuda na Ababenjamini bonsi, na korwa ase abanto ba Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chibesa chiria chikaegwa abateneneri b’emeremo yare gokorerwa ase enyomba y’Omonene; na barabwo bagachiaa abanto barenge koroisia enyomba y’Omonene na koyeagacha naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagachia abasenia be chibao, na abaagachi bagore amagena abaachire, amo nemete y’okoroiseria emeriibo, na emiamba, ase okoagacha amaagacho aria abarwoti b’Abayuda batigete agatagoka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abwo bagakora emeremo ase obwegenwa. Aba nabwo abateneneri babegetwe igoro ase bare: Yahati na Obadia, Abalawi b’ororeria rwa Merari, na Zakaria, na Mesulamu b’ororeria rwa Kohati, na Abalawi bonsi bamanyete kobugia ebinto bi’amatera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bagatenenera ababogoretie chigurube, naende bakaba abateebereria b’abakori emeremo ao ao. Abande b’Abalawi bakaba abariki, na abande abateneneri ao ao, na abande abarendi b’ebiita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero barenge korenta chitaabu chiria konya chiarentirwe ase enyomba y’Omonene, Hilikia Omokuani akanyora Egetabu ki’Amachiko ’Omonene yarwetwe goetera ase Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Hilikia agateebia Safani omoriki, “Nanyorire Egetabu y’Amachiko ime ase enyomba y’Omonene,” akaa Safani egetabu eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Safani akaira egetabu eria ase omorwoti, naende akamoteebia, “Emeremo yonsi kwaete abasomba bao nkoyekora bare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bairire chitaabu chionsi chianyorekanete ase enyomba y’Omonene, na bachibekire ase amaboko ’abateneneri b’emeremo amo nabakori emeremo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Safani omoriki agateebia omorwoti, “Hilikia Omokuani ong’eire egetabu eke.” Erio akayesoma agwo ase obosio bw’omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omorwoti aigwete amang’ana ’amachiiko aria, agatandora chianga chiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agachiika Hilikia, na Ahikamu, mosinto o Safani, na Abidoni, mosinto o Mika, na Safani omoriki, na Asaia, omosomba bw’omorwoti, akabateebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Genda, moborie momanye korwa ase Omonene igoro yane na igoro y’abatigari b’Abaisraeli na ab’Abayuda, tomanye amang’ana are ase egetabu eke yanyorekanire. Endamwamu y’Omonene nentindi mono ase tore, ekiagera chisokoro chiaito tichiaigwerete ring’ana ri’Omonene, naende tichiakorete onsi aya ariikire ase egetabu eke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hilikia amo nabaanto omorwoti atomete bakagenda ase Hulda, omokungu omobani moka Salumu, mosinto o Tokihati o Hasira. Salumu nere orenge omorendi bwe rigachero rie chianga agwo Hekalu. (Ase ekero ekio Hulda nigo amenyete agwo Yerusalemu ase ensemo enyia.) Abanto abwo bagateebia omokungu oria amang’ana aria aria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokungu oria akabateebia, “Aya nar’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Mogende ase omonto oria obatomete gocha ase ’nde, momoteebie:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Rora, nindete igoro y’aase aiga, na igoro y’abanto b’aiga okoragererigwa gwonsi korikire ase egetabu eke yasomwa ase omorwoti bw’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bantigire inche, na basambire ubani ase chinyasae ching’ao, na bangechirie nabeire nendamwamu ase engencho y’emeremo yonsi bakorire namaboko abo. Ase ayio endamwamu yane neiterwe igoro y’aase aiga, tegokendigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ase omorwoti bw’Abayuda, oria obatoma, erinde amanye korwa ase ’nde inche Omonene, aya naro moramoteebie: Aya nar’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli agoteeba: Ekero kwaigwa amang’ana aria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aye ogekanya okaba omoitongo ase obosio bwane inche Nyasae, naende ekero kwaigwa amang’ana igoro y’aase aiga, na igoro y’abanto bareo, ogatandora chianga chiao, naende okarera ase obosio bwane. Naboigo inche Omonene nkogoteebia, ng’a nakoigure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora, ningosangererie ase chisokoro chiao chiachiete; aye nobekwe ase embeera yao kore nomorembe, na amaiso ao takorora obobe boria bwonsi ndarete igoro y’aase aiga, na igoro y’abanto bareo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ase igo barabwo bakairera omorwoti amang’ana ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosia ogokora okobwatana kw’ogotianania ng’a naigwere Omonene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 23:1-20)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti agatoma amang’ana, agasangereria amo abagaaka b’Abayuda na aba Yerusalemu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na agatiira gochia ase enyomba y’Omonene, amo n’Abayuda bonsi na bonsi abamenyete Yerusalemu, na abakuani, na Abalawi, ee, abanto bonsi, abanene na abake. Na aroro omorwoti akabasomera amang’ana onsi ariikire ase Egetabu keria gi’Okobwatana kw’Ogotianania, yanyorekanete ime ase enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti agatenena aase aye, agakora okobwatana kw’ogotianania ase obosio bw’Omonene ng’a nabwatie Omonene, na abwate amachiiko aye, na oborori bwaye, na emeroberio yaye echiikire, nayakore nenkoro yaye yonsi na omoyo oye bwonsi, nakore amang’ana onsi aganeirie nokobwatana okwo kw’ogotianania, ayarikire ase egetabu eke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agachiika abanto bonsi abarenge agwo Yerusalemu na aba ase orogongo rwa Benjamini babwatane nokobwatana okwo kw’ogotianania, na abanto ba Yerusalemu bagakora koreng’ana nokobwatana koria kwa Nyasae ore Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia akarusia okogechia gwonsi korwa ase orogongo rw’Abaisraeli, agachiika Abaisraeli bonsi bakorere Omonene, Nyasae obo. Abanto tibaonchogete korwa ase Omonene bwe chisokoro chiabo ase obogima bwonsi bwa Yosia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
